    <div class="bio">
      <div id="bio-text">
        <p>Victoria Howe is a founder, speaker and pitch specialist based in Perth, Western Australia. After around ten years as a police officer, the last few as a detective, she built South West Snails from the ground up and secured a $100,000 grant. A Women in Business Award winner and contributing author of <em>Purpose and Passion</em>, Victoria now helps founders communicate so people understand them, as a mentor on Plus Eight programs and a pitch masterclass facilitator with Innovation Shed and the City of Joondalup Pre-Accelerator. Her style is practical, warm and direct: "Your goal isn't to impress people. It's to be understood."</p>
